            "objective": "Wait until the next day (08:00 – 12:00)",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "7351901",
            "objective": "Talk to Vinayak",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "735190101",
                    "speaker": "Vinayak",
                    "text": "I don't understand... She was the one who mentioned the idea of going to the café to write the report...",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "735190102",
                            "text": "Why are you here by yourself?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "735190104",
                                    "speaker": "Vinayak",
                                    "text": "*sigh* I don't want to talk about it. She's off to work on the report by herself."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "735190105",
                                    "speaker": "Vinayak",
                                    "text": "We were supposed to meet at the café yesterday, but it took her a long time to show up. She didn't even bring any pen or paper for her report!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "735190106",
                                    "speaker": "Vinayak",
                                    "text": "I criticized her for wasting time when we should be working on the report, and then she flew into a rage! She said she'd write the report herself and made me leave!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "735190107",
                                    "speaker": "Vinayak",
                                    "text": "This is ridiculous, don't you think?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "735190108",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "735190109",
                                    "speaker": "Vinayak",
                                    "text": "Still, I'm used to her fiery temper. She'll simmer down in a couple days."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "735190110",
                                    "speaker": "Vinayak",
                                    "text": "If only controlling her emotions was as simple as flipping a switch.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "735190111",
                                            "text": "Best of luck.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735190113",
                                                    "speaker": "Vinayak",
                                                    "text": "Huh? Even you're acting strange... Oh well, never mind. There are still a few affected Wenut around here, though I'm sure the situation will resolve itself if I just leave it alone."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735190114",
                                                    "speaker": "Vinayak",
                                                    "text": "But if you have time, please help prevent them from threatening passers-by."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735190115",
                                                    "speaker": "Vinayak",
                                                    "text": "By the way, the elemental environment and the charging device are now back to normal."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735190116",
                                                    "speaker": "Vinayak",
                                                    "text": "There's never been a better time to experience the Wenutslayer Cannon at full power!"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "735190112",
                                            "text": "Good luck to you."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "735190103",
                            "text": "Where's Shriya?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
